<title>USA: Optical Data August sales reach $4.3 mln.</title>
<headline>Optical Data August sales reach $4.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>ROANOKE, Va 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Optical Cable Corp said Tuesday it had record sales of $4.34 million in August.</p>
<p>&quot;Business activity was well above target for August with accelerating demand for (our) product in all market segments,&quot; it said.  </p>
<p>The company also said it had hired an international sales manager for Central and South America, which it saw as a large business potential.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
